    - :func:`jax.numpy.histogram`: Compute the histogram of a 1D array.
    - :func:`jax.numpy.histogram2d`: Compute the histogram of a 2D array.
    - :func:`jax.numpy.histogram_bin_edges`: Compute the bin edges for a histogram.

